# OpenGGS furnace convention — PASS 1 (bootstrap).
#
# Deliberately minimal: state reads and writes only, one corpus-wide row. Every
# other event kind is expected to land in the slag, and the slag is what names
# the rows pass 2 adds. A bootstrap convention that already classified
# everything would produce no residual and therefore no signal.

classify Read
classify Write
classify ReadWrite

row depth=0 concern=State
